  "full_passage_spoken": "I eat three meals a day. Breakfast is one meal. Lunch is at school. Dinner is at home. I eat on time. I do not skip a meal. Regular meals give me energy. They help me study. Three meals are breakfast, lunch, and dinner. I do not skip lunch even when I am busy. On time meals give me energy to study.",
  "topic_zh": "一日三餐",
